#Scattering method
  1	                  1=exact phase function, 2=hg function with same g (2 implies the loss of polarizarion)

#Symmetries
  F	                  image symmetry
  F	                  central symmetry
  F	                  axial symmetry (important only if N_phi > 1)

#Disk physics
